{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04092","headline":"奉和马常侍寺中之作 · 苏頲","name":"奉和马常侍寺中之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怨暑时云谢，愆阳泽暂偏。\n鼎陈从祀日，钥动问刑年。\n绦服龙雩寝，玄冠马使旋。\n作霖期傅说，爲旱听周宣。\n河岳阴符啓，星辰暗檄传。\n浮凉吹景气，飞动洒空烟。\n飒飒将秋近，沈沈与暝连。\n分湍泾水石，合颖雍州田。\n德施超三五，文雄赋十千。\n及斯何以乐，明主敬人天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}